  "description": "Drive a Trax state machine a host serves from .NET: Blazor, MAUI, Avalonia, WPF or another service. Sends each operation by the persisted id the host's client manifest lists, follows the instance over a graphql-transport-ws socket, predicts each event with the Trax.StateMachine engine and replaces the prediction with what the server stored. Every operation answers a refusal or a transport failure as a value.",
